{"id":"g9pfmt55jhcs72gs6hkc4coyt","title":"导电金刚石的功能化：制造、改良与应用的最新进展","originalTitle":"贵州大学Jing Xu Carbon Energy综述：导电金刚石的功能化：制造、改良与应用的最新进展","summary":"贵州大学Jing Xu在Carbon Energy上综述了导电金刚石在合成、改性及应用领域的最新进展。文章详细介绍了四种主流合成技术（HPHT、HFCVD、MWCVD和DC Arc Plasma Jet CVD）及其成本效益，并探讨了掺杂工程、表面终端化处理和应力管理等改性策略，展示了导电金刚石在能源存储、电催化、环境修复和传感等领域的广泛应用。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=3424837&do=blog&id=1560871"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T04:45:20.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-12T10:25:13.120Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-12T10:25:13.120Z","category":"materials-energy","tags":["论文发表","DeepMind"],"score":37,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"cbb56d26-bc06-42a5-879a-4598719fcf7d","title":"贵州大学系统解析导电金刚石合成技术与改性应用"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"cbb56d26-bc06-42a5-879a-4598719fcf7d","title":"贵州大学系统解析导电金刚石合成技术与改性应用"}],"topics":[{"slug":"deepmind","name":"DeepMind"},{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"f6lyI0f8-MRQ","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}